# A parenthesized group tolerates a newline anywhere inside it (`spec/grammar.md:34`) — after the
# `(`, mid-expression, and at any nesting depth — and its `)` still matches, so none of these
# raise the phantom `ol-unmatched-paren` cascade of issue #933.
print (1 +
  2)
print (
  1 + 2
)
print (1 + (2 *
  3))
print [ (1 +
  2) ]
